  "prefLabel": "Lab 1402.11 Double block and bleed",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lab 1402.11 “Double block and bleed” means the closure of a line, duct, or pipe by closing and locking or tagging 2 in-line valves and by opening and locking or tagging a drain or vent valve in the line between the 2 closed valves.\n\nSource. #14431, eff 11-22-25, EXPIRES: 11-22-35",
